      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "AI can autocomplete and debug code, but it still doesn’t understand it.\nToday’s LLMs miss context, struggle with large systems, and hallucinate fixes.\nThe next leap isn’t better syntax—it’s capturing developer intent. 🧠💡\n#AI #Coding #SoftwareEngineering",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "estienneantoin1",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "4361546003"
