      "created_at" : "Fri Apr 22 14:54:27 +0000 2022",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "However, be aware that there are limits to deploying NFTs in parallel in terms of throughput…. This is what we are going to discuss in the next part of the article.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "estienneantoin1",
